@title 3D view: Move is off by default, so a plain drag cannot move a duct through the wall
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# Hardware test KC-15: the 3D toolbar opened with Move on and a drag meant to look around moved parts. Front view, select K1 (365,380 at 1366x768 with the 3D view pane docked at the right; the view then zooms to its plate, where K1 spans 447-646 x 414-542): with Move off a drag leaves it at 55, 210 mm; after the Move icon (24,118) the same drag moves it.
open_starter_example
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click 975 124
wait 40
click 365 380
wait 20
expect "55, 210 mm"
shot move-off
drag 540 480 640 480
wait 30
expect "55, 210 mm"
shot move-off-dragged
click 24 118
wait 10
drag 540 480 640 480
wait 30
expect_not "55, 210 mm"
shot move-on-dragged
